{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dkleptsov/skill-security-review/commits/main", "fetched_at": 1795289706.498614, "data": {"sha": "d19fd5eff9762bada5ab2f18b0417f7e8d3f4fef", "node_id": "C_kwDOTS3tQdoAKGQxOWZkNWVmZjk3NjJiYWRhNWFiMmYxOGIwNDE3ZjdlOGQzZjRmZWY", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Denis Kleptsov", "email": "denis@kleptsov.com", "date": "2026-08-30T11:50:02Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Denis Kleptsov", "email": "denis@kleptsov.com", "date": "2026-08-30T11:50:02Z"}, "message": "Stream an oversized transcript by name, not just by extension\n\nA 51 MB session.json was still skipped whole while session.jsonl streamed,\nso renaming the file was enough to disable the trace rules. The oversized\npath now also triggers on the transcript name pattern. Verified by hand on a\nrenamed copy of a real session: 191 blocks, identical to the .jsonl run.", "tree": {"sha": "d008ee75caf48c094d332f7eab6054c3894a66a8", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dkleptsov/skill-security-review/git/trees/d008ee75caf48c094d332f7eab6054c3894a66a8"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dkleptsov/skill-security-review/git/commits/d19fd5eff9762bada5ab2f18b0417f7e8d3f4fef", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dkleptsov/skill-security-review/commits/d19fd5eff9762bada5ab2f18b0417f7e8d3f4fef", "html_url": "https://github.com/dkleptsov/skill-security-review/commit/d19fd5eff9762bada5ab2f18b0417f7e8d3f4fef", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dkleptsov/skill-security-review/commits/d19fd5eff9762bada5ab2f18b0417f7e8d3f4fef/comments", "author": {"login": "dkleptsov", "id": 47938353, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTM4MzUz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47938353?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dkleptsov", "html_url": "https://github.com/dkleptsov", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dkleptsov/fo